        "metadata": {
            "uuid": "RationaleClaim_NonSafety_RearLight_HazardWarning_@ab3e0733",
            "description": [
                "EL-HAZ-1.4 on RearLight is implied by EL-HAZ-1.4.1 and 1.4.2: RLCM copies Left/RightTurnLightRequest one to one to ReqLeft/ReqRight on RearLightLIN, and DEVS2 lights the rear turn lamps from ReqLeft/ReqRight. Neither adds timing or state, so the rear lamps follow TurnLightControl.",
                "",
                "RL takes no part: it answers only RLCM's diagnostic counter (SomeReq1, counter_times_2) and drives no turn lamp.",
                "",
                "```mermaid",
                "flowchart LR",
                "  in[\"TurnLightControl\"] --> rlcm[\"RLCM<br/>1.4.1 copy\"]",
                "  rlcm -->|\"ReqLeft, ReqRight\"| devs2[\"DEVS2<br/>1.4.2 follow\"]",
                "  devs2 --> out[\"Lamp_RearLeftTurn<br/>Lamp_RearRightTurn\"]",
                "```"
            ],
            "name": "RationaleClaim_NonSafety_RearLight_HazardWarning",
            "version_schema": "4.6.2"
        }
    }
